---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="IAG - Serviços Especializados">
    <!-- Hero da Página -->
    <section class="bg-iag-gradient relative py-20 text-white overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAiIHhtbG5zPSJodHRwOi8vd3d3LnczLm9yZy8yMDAwL3N2ZyI+PGNpcmNsZSBjeD0iMSIgY3k9IjEiIHI9IjEiIGZpbGw9InJnYmEoMjU1LDI1NSwyNTUsMC4wNSkiLz48L3N2Zz4=')] opacity-30"></div>
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs inline-block mb-3">
                <span class="lang-pt">Ciência Aplicada ao Campo</span><span class="lang-en">Applied Science in the Field</span>
            </span>
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-4">
                <span class="lang-pt">Nossos Serviços</span><span class="lang-en">Our Services</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                <span class="lang-pt">Soluções tecnológicas avançadas divididas em duas grandes frentes para maximizar a sua rentabilidade e segurança agrícola.</span>
                <span class="lang-en">Advanced technological solutions divided into two major fronts to maximize your profitability and agricultural safety.</span>
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Serviços Biomoleculares -->
    <section id="biomol" class="py-24 bg-white scroll-mt-20">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
                <!-- Texto -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-7">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
                        <i class="fas fa-dna"></i>
                        <span class="lang-pt">Genética de Alta Precisão</span><span class="lang-en">High Precision Genetics</span>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6 leading-tight">
                        <span class="lang-pt">Serviços Biomoleculares</span><span class="lang-en">Biomolecular Services</span>
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                        <span class="lang-pt">No laboratório de biologia molecular do IAG, aplicamos técnicas genéticas avançadas de PCR (Reação em Cadeia da Polimerase) e sequenciamento de DNA. Auxiliamos sementeiras, melhoristas e agricultores na validação e proteção de suas tecnologias biológicas.</span>
                        <span class="lang-en">In IAG's molecular biology laboratory, we apply advanced genetic techniques of PCR (Polymerase Chain Reaction) and DNA sequencing. We support seed producers, breeders, and farmers in validating and protecting their biological technologies.</span>
                    </p>

                    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                        <div class="border border-slate-100 p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">
                                <span class="lang-pt">Controle de Pureza Genética</span><span class="lang-en">Genetic Purity Control</span>
                            </h4>
                            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                <span class="lang-pt">Verificação de misturas varietais e conformidade de lotes de sementes comerciais para garantir o padrão genético.</span>
                                <span class="lang-en">Verification of varietal mixtures and compliance of commercial seed lots to guarantee genetic standards.</span>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="border border-slate-100 p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">
                                <span class="lang-pt">Detecção de Transgenia (OGM)</span><span class="lang-en">Transgenics Detection (GMO)</span>
                            </h4>
                            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                <span class="lang-pt">Ensaios qualitativos e quantitativos para identificar eventos transgênicos específicos em carregamentos ou campos experimentais.</span>
                                <span class="lang-en">Qualitative and quantitative tests to identify specific transgenic events in shipments or experimental fields.</span>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="border border-slate-100 p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">
                                <span class="lang-pt">Seleção Assistida por Marcadores</span><span class="lang-en">Marker-Assisted Selection</span>
                            </h4>
                            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                <span class="lang-pt">Identificação rápida de plantas portadoras de genes de resistência (ex: nematoides e fungos) acelerando o melhoramento.</span>
                                <span class="lang-en">Fast identification of plants carrying resistance genes (e.g., nematodes and fungi), accelerating breeding.</span>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="border border-slate-100 p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">
                                <span class="lang-pt">Identificação de Patógenos</span><span class="lang-en">Pathogen Identification</span>
                            </h4>
                            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                <span class="lang-pt">Diagnóstico molecular precoce de vírus, bactérias e fungos fitopatogênicos em plantas e sementes.</span>
                                <span class="lang-en">Early molecular diagnosis of phytopathogenic viruses, bacteria, and fungi in plants and seeds.</span>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Imagem/Card Ilustrativo -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-emerald-500/10 to-blue-500/10 rounded-3xl blur-2xl"></div>
                    <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 relative z-10 shadow-xl">
                        <img src="/rastreabilidade_lab.jpg" alt="Rastreabilidade e Biologia Molecular" class="rounded-2xl w-full h-[250px] object-cover mb-6 border border-slate-100" />
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2"><span class="lang-pt">Rastreabilidade Total</span><span class="lang-en">Complete Traceability</span></h4>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                            <span class="lang-pt">Nossos ensaios seguem diretrizes internacionais de controle. Cada amostra recebe um código único de identificação digital, eliminando erros de troca de lote.</span>
                            <span class="lang-en">Our assays follow international control guidelines. Each sample receives a unique digital ID, preventing batch mix-ups.</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Serviços de Solo (Resumo e Link) -->
    <section id="solo" class="py-24 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-100 scroll-mt-20">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
                <!-- Imagem/Card Ilustrativo -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 order-2 lg:order-1 relative">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-amber-500/10 to-yellow-500/10 rounded-3xl blur-2xl"></div>
                    <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 relative z-10 shadow-xl">
                        <img src="/18agronegociobiotecnologia.jpg" alt="Solo Fértil" class="rounded-2xl w-full h-[250px] object-cover mb-6 border border-slate-100" />
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2"><span class="lang-pt">Análise Química e Física</span><span class="lang-en">Chemical and Physical Analysis</span></h4>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium">
                            <span class="lang-pt">Determinamos macronutrientes, micronutrientes, alumínio, matéria orgânica e a granulometria do solo.</span>
                            <span class="lang-en">We determine macronutrients, micronutrients, aluminum, organic matter, and soil particle size distribution.</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Texto -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 order-1 lg:order-2">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-700 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
                        <i class="fas fa-seedling"></i>
                        <span class="lang-pt">Nutrição Vegetal</span><span class="lang-en">Plant Nutrition</span>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6 leading-tight">
                        <span class="lang-pt">Análise de Solos (Nosso Foco Principal)</span><span class="lang-en">Soil Analysis (Our Main Focus)</span>
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                        <span class="lang-pt">A análise de solo do IAG é reconhecida pela rapidez e precisão nos resultados. Mapeamos as necessidades exatas de calcário, gesso e fertilizantes para corrigir o solo de forma eficiente e econômica, otimizando os custos com adubação.</span>
                        <span class="lang-en">IAG's soil analysis is recognized for its speed and precision in results. We map the exact needs for limestone, gypsum, and fertilizers to correct the soil efficiently and economically, optimizing fertilization costs.</span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                        <span class="lang-pt">Desenvolvemos uma página inteira e exclusiva com tabelas de parâmetros, guias de amostragem no campo e recomendações. Veja no link abaixo todos os detalhes.</span>
                        <span class="lang-en">We have developed an exclusive page with parameters tables, field sampling guides, and recommendations. Click the link below to view all details.</span>
                    </p>
                    <a href="/solos" class="bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white font-bold py-3.5 px-8 rounded-lg transition-transform transform hover:-translate-y-1 inline-block shadow-md">
                        <span class="lang-pt">Ir para Análise de Solos</span><span class="lang-en">Go to Soil Analysis</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Assessoria Agronômica Integrada -->
    <section class="py-24 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center max-w-4xl">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-8 border border-blue-200">
                <i class="fas fa-hands-helping"></i>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">
                <span class="lang-pt">Assessoria Técnica e Recomendação</span><span class="lang-en">Technical Support & Recommendations</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg mb-10 leading-relaxed">
                <span class="lang-pt">Mais do que apenas entregar números, nossa equipe de agrônomos ajuda você a interpretar os laudos de solo e biologia molecular. Desenvolvemos recomendações customizadas de manejo corretivo e nutricional alinhadas ao seu potencial produtivo e orçamento.</span>
                <span class="lang-en">More than just delivering figures, our team of agronomists helps you interpret soil reports and molecular biology results. We develop customized corrective and nutritional management recommendations aligned with your yield potential and budget.</span>
            </p>
            <a href="/#contato" class="bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white font-bold py-3.5 px-8 rounded-lg transition-all inline-block shadow-sm">
                <span class="lang-pt">Falar com Nosso Laboratório</span><span class="lang-en">Talk to Our Laboratory</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
